<title>USA: Applied Materials acquires Opal and Orbot.</title>
<headline>Applied Materials acquires Opal and Orbot.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Materials Inc said it completed the acquisitions of Opal Inc for about $175 million in cash, and Orbot Instruments Ltd for about $110 million in cash.</p>
<p>Applied Materials said its entry into the metrology and inspection equipment market is consistent with its long-standing strategy to grow through innovation and commercialization.</p>
</text>
